  "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semiotic_projection_1",
  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the woman in the construction scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman in the construction scene. The meme's sarcastic framing — 'equality in the work place at its finest' — implicitly positions the viewer to see the woman as the 'finest' example of equality, thereby projecting the user's own perspective onto her as the subject of this ironic commentary. The user is not explicitly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the visual focus and the textual claim create an implicit projection where the user is invited to interpret the woman's presence as the pinnacle of equality, reinforcing the misogynous stereotype that her participation is exceptional or rare.",
  "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface",
